--- what the admin website sends for lesson workflow transitions (app/lessons/[lessonId]/page.tsx: body.version = lesson.version)
REJECTED  TransitionDto (submit/approve/publish/unpublish) with admin payload  body={"version":3}
          -> {"code":"VALIDATION_FAILED","message":"Request validation failed","details":[{"field":"version","messages":["property version should not exist"]}]}
REJECTED  RequestChangesDto with admin payload  body={"version":3,"note":"please fix"}
          -> {"code":"VALIDATION_FAILED","message":"Request validation failed","details":[{"field":"version","messages":["property version should not exist"]}]}
--- what the backend contract accepts
ACCEPTED  TransitionDto with expectedContentRevision  body={"expectedContentRevision":3}
ACCEPTED  TransitionDto with empty body  body={}
